WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.391
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ko Grocery ya Kirana dukaan ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:06.391 --> 00:00:11.984
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai, aur dukaan ka naam hai Sharma Kirana Store.

00:00:11.984 --> 00:00:21.571
Kirana mein sabse zaroori cheez speed hai, isliye hum Fast Billing se shuru karenge, aur phir udhaar, stock, purchases aur reports tak jaayenge.

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:23.252
Ye Home screen hai.

00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:31.756
Yahan aaj ki sales, customers se kitna udhaar lena hai, kaunsa saaman kam ho raha hai, aur shop health score ek nazar mein.

00:00:31.756 --> 00:00:40.813
Neeche teen kaam jo aaj karne chahiye: overdue udhaar ki vasooli, kam stock ka reorder, aur wo customer jo aana band kar rahe hain.

00:00:40.813 --> 00:00:48.349
Kyun? Kyunki kirana mein hazaar chhote chhote kaam hote hain, aur sabse zaroori kaam roz upar dikhna chahiye.

00:00:48.709 --> 00:00:55.579
Ab Fast Billing. Ye counter ka sabse tez raasta hai. Bade tiles par tap karo aur item bill mein.

00:00:55.579 --> 00:01:02.090
Categories upar hain. Chaar item jodte hain: Sugar, Tata Salt, Amul Milk aur Parle G. Kyun?

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:08.960
Kyunki ek ghante mein sau customer aate hain, aur har ek ko dus second se kam mein nipatana hai.

00:01:11.552 --> 00:01:13.641
Neeche View Bill dabate hain.

00:01:13.641 --> 00:01:21.278
Cart mein payment ka tareeka chuno, cash, U P I, card ya udhaar, aur chaho to customer ka naam aur mobile.

00:01:21.278 --> 00:01:22.863
Aur bill ban jata hai.

00:01:22.863 --> 00:01:30.283
Fast Billing mein wahi pricing, GST aur stock chalta hai jo normal billing mein, bas raasta chhota hai.

00:01:30.814 --> 00:01:36.372
Ab normal New Bill, jab customer ke saath khata jodna ho ya barcode scan karna ho.

00:01:36.372 --> 00:01:39.829
Item ka naam likh ke search karte hain, jaise Atta.

00:01:39.829 --> 00:01:44.845
Camera se barcode scan bhi hota hai, aur bol ke bhi likhwa sakte ho. Kyun?

00:01:44.845 --> 00:01:48.505
Kyunki alag alag samay par alag tareeka tez padta hai.

00:01:48.902 --> 00:01:55.906
Neeche ek suggestion bhi aayi: Often bought with this, yaani jo customer atta ke saath aksar leta hai.

00:01:55.906 --> 00:02:02.361
Ek tap se jud jaata hai. Kyun? Kyunki customer bhoolta hai, aur dukandaar ki bikri badhti hai.

00:02:02.361 --> 00:02:08.473
Discount aur part payment ke baad baaki udhaar khata mein chadhta hai, jaisa pehle dekha.

00:02:08.858 --> 00:02:12.856
Customers. Har customer ke saamne settled ya kitna baaki.

00:02:12.856 --> 00:02:17.344
Ajay Khan ka baaki ab pehle se zyada hai, jo abhi bill se badha.

00:02:17.344 --> 00:02:20.780
Kholte hain to History mein har bill aur payment.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:25.269
Payment received se jab paisa aata hai, balance kam ho jata hai.

00:02:38.607 --> 00:02:39.728
Udhaar reminders.

00:02:39.728 --> 00:02:49.352
Sabhi customers ki list jinka paisa baaki hai, kitne din se pending hai, aur ek tap ka Remind button, jo WhatsApp par message tayyar kar deta hai.

00:02:49.352 --> 00:02:52.516
Sabko ek saath chun kar bhi bhej sakte ho. Kyun?

00:02:52.516 --> 00:02:57.658
Kyunki mahine bhar ka udhaar yaad rakhne se behtar hai ki app roz yaad dilaye.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.113
Loyalty program.

00:02:59.113 --> 00:03:05.473
Har sau rupaye ki kharid par kitne points, aur ek point ki kimat kitni, ye yahan tay hota hai.

00:03:05.473 --> 00:03:09.871
Points sirf diye hue paise par milte hain, udhaar par nahi. Kyun?

00:03:09.871 --> 00:03:15.961
Kyunki loyalty points wapas aane ki wajah hain, aur regular customer sabse kimti hota hai.

00:03:16.339 --> 00:03:21.486
Birthdays. Aane wale tees din ke customers ke janamdin, aur Wish ka button.

00:03:21.486 --> 00:03:26.289
Ek message aur customer ko lagta hai dukaan use yaad rakhti hai. Kyun?

00:03:26.289 --> 00:03:31.230
Kyunki chhota sa message aksar poori family ko wapas dukaan le aata hai.

00:03:36.887 --> 00:03:45.073
Ab Products. Har item ke saath uska GST percent, H S N code, stock aur barcode. Ek item ko kholte hain.

00:03:45.073 --> 00:03:50.557
Price, GST, unit, barcode, aur stock ki ginti aur kam stock ki seema.

00:03:50.557 --> 00:03:54.929
H S N code isliye ki GST return mein zaroori hai. Kyun?

00:03:54.929 --> 00:03:59.618
Kyunki ek baar sahi bhar diya to har bill khud sahi banega.

00:04:01.463 --> 00:04:02.846
Aur barcode labels.

00:04:02.846 --> 00:04:10.779
Jin items par sticker lagana ho, plus se ginti chuno, aur thermal roll ya A four sheet mein print karo. Kyun?

00:04:10.779 --> 00:04:15.874
Kyunki barcode lagne ke baad scanner se bill dus guna tez ho jata hai.

00:04:16.253 --> 00:04:20.499
Ab Purchases. Vendor se maal aaya to yahan likhte hain.

00:04:20.499 --> 00:04:28.450
Vendor Anand Wholesale, unka invoice number, aur item Toor Dal, quantity chaubees aur rate ek sau tees.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:35.166
Save purchase dabate hi stock badh jata hai aur input GST ka record ban jata hai. Kyun?

00:04:35.166 --> 00:04:40.184
Kyunki maal ki kharid ka hisaab na ho to munafa pata nahi chalta.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:45.891
Reorder screen batati hai ki kya kam hai aur kitne din mein khatam hoga.

00:04:45.891 --> 00:04:51.962
Vendor chuno aur ek tap mein purchase bana lo, ya WhatsApp par list bhej do. Kyun?

00:04:51.962 --> 00:04:56.331
Kyunki stock khatam hone se pehle mangwana asli bachat hai.

00:04:56.701 --> 00:04:58.343
Vendor price comparison.

00:04:58.343 --> 00:05:06.622
Ek hi item ko alag alag vendor se kharida ho to dono ke rate saath dikhte hain, aur sabse sasta vendor pehchana jata hai.

00:05:06.622 --> 00:05:11.137
Jaise Basmati Rice mein ek vendor ka rate doosre se kam hai. Kyun?

00:05:11.137 --> 00:05:14.832
Kyunki sahi vendor chunne se seedha munafa badhta hai.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.623
Ab din ka hisaab.

00:05:16.623 --> 00:05:26.755
Daily summary mein cash, card aur U P I se kitna aaya aur vendors ko kitna gaya, aur drawer mein kitna cash hona chahiye.

00:05:26.755 --> 00:05:31.611
Kyun? Kyunki shaam ko ginti se milaana hi asli hisaab hai.

00:05:31.979 --> 00:05:39.887
GSTR 1 aur GSTR 3B aur Purchase register, GST ke teen reports. GSTR 1 mein sales, B2B aur B2C.

00:05:39.887 --> 00:05:45.524
GSTR 3B mein output tax minus input credit, yaani kitna bharna hai.

00:05:45.524 --> 00:05:50.068
Purchase register mein vendor wise input credit. Kyun?

00:05:50.068 --> 00:05:56.630
Kyunki ye teen CA ko mahine mein ek baar chahiye, aur yahan tayyar milte hain.

00:05:56.991 --> 00:05:58.964
Aakhir mein Profit Leak.

00:05:58.964 --> 00:06:15.983
Isme paisa phansne ki teen jagah: bina bika stock, jaise Olive Oil aur Muesli jo teen mahine se nahi bike, purana udhaar jo tees din se zyada ka hai, aur wo item jo kharid se sasta bik raha hai, jaise Sugar.

00:06:15.983 --> 00:06:24.122
Har ek par Dekhein dabao to poori list. Kyun? Kyunki nuksan tab tak nahi rukta jab tak dikhta nahi.

00:06:24.512 --> 00:06:31.301
Insights mein fast movers, yaani jo tez bik rahe hain, aur dead stock, jo mahine se nahi bika.

00:06:31.301 --> 00:06:41.124
Aur Udhaar aging mein udhaar tees din tak, tees se saath din, ya usse zyada ke group mein, jisse pata chalta hai kise pehle pakadna hai.

00:06:41.124 --> 00:06:45.963
Kyun? Kyunki purana udhaar wapas milne ki umeed kam hoti jaati hai.

00:06:47.704 --> 00:07:03.932
Aaj humne Kirana ka poora flow dekha: Fast Billing, barcode search wala bill, khata aur reminders, loyalty aur birthday, products aur barcode labels, purchases aur reorder, vendor comparison, daily summary, GST reports, aur profit leak.

00:07:03.932 --> 00:07:10.877
Ek practical baat: roz shaam ko Daily summary se cash milao aur hafte mein ek baar Profit leak dekho.

00:07:10.877 --> 00:07:14.315
Chhoti cheezein hi bade nuksan roki hui hoti hain.
